Licensing
=========

DBMS Server: GNU AGPLv3

DBMS Client: GNU LGPLv3

Polygon Libraries: GPC or GNU AGPLv3
    The libraries (GPC / Altibase CE) are interchangeable and can be selected in the DB config file.
    As of 2020, the GPC license restrictions are no longer in effect.
    Sources: [Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Polygon_Clipper) and
    [GitHub](https://github.com/rickbrew/GeneralPolygonClipper).

Demo Containers: GNU AGPLv3
    Container images are for demonstration purposes only and are not intended for production use.

Binary Builds: Commercial
    While the project's source code is available under the licenses listed above,
    ready-to-use binary distributions can be provided on a paid basis.
    Please contact us via email to inquire about terms and conditions.
